#: src/Privacy.php:17
msgid "We send transactional cash-on-delivery verification emails using our WordPress email transport. CODVerity stores order references, verification decisions, timestamps, audit events and keyed duplicate fingerprints. Verification links expire and are invalidated after resolution. Active verification data is retained until resolved; audit events are normally pruned after 90 days, and resolved request secrets after 365 days. Minimal enrollment records remain to prevent duplicate verification. The store can configure retention and assist with personal-data requests."
msgstr ""

